# Full-sweep output: ~36k generations with reasoning traces, hundreds of MB.
runs/main/
runs/aime/
runs/sweep*/

# Content-addressed response cache: too large and too churny to version, and
# NOT regenerable — three models have been withdrawn from the provider and
# temperature 0 does not reproduce on 17 of 18 (FINDINGS 2, 3). What makes the
# results reproducible is the committed `runs/**/*.cells.jsonl`, which retain
# the raw completions, so every verdict re-derives without the cache. Archive
# the cache alongside a submission rather than assuming it can be rebuilt.
cache/
runs/matrix/.budget.json
